WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.125
Install version 0.1.0 with Python 3.12. The semantic extra enables local embeddings; this tutorial uses BM25.

2
00:00:12.125 --> 00:00:18.344
Check the installed version before following the versioned documentation.

3
00:00:18.344 --> 00:00:28.906
Run health checks. Resolve required failures before continuing. The local BM25 tutorial needs no account or API key.

4
00:00:28.906 --> 00:00:42.063
Evaluate ten answerable questions at k=2. Compare body text with heading context while keeping questions and retrieval depth fixed.

5
00:00:42.063 --> 00:00:53.688
Open the generated HTML report locally. The tutorial records 60% versus 90% evidence sufficiency. This is bundled example data.

6
00:00:53.688 --> 00:01:05.760
Open a question's ranked evidence. Three questions improved, none regressed, and one remains insufficient.
